# GMS gives this 150+2x% four times on eight enemies, and gives Phase Dash
# 320+5x% twice on the same eight -- 760% against 840% at master, off a swing
# 270ms shorter. Phase Dash is simply the better skill, and two buttons where
# one is strictly worse is not a choice.
#
# So the two are one skill here: Midnight Carnival's four lines carrying Phase
# Dash's total. 750ms is Midnight Carnival's own, from the frame data.
#
# Five enemies against GMS's eight: 360x210 is one storey and holds five
# abreast. Phase Dash's own 380x125 gives the same five. See Skill.max_enemies.
name: "Midnight Carnival"
description: "Overwhelm enemies with supersonic slashes."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_CHIEF_BANDIT skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 20
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_DAGGER
base_delay_ms: 750
max_enemies: 5
lines: 4
base { skill_pct: 1.72 }
per_level { skill_pct: 0.02 }
